  "summary": "As an owner, you are way too busy to be worrying about having to wrestle with a website. Starting a web development project can feel daunting. A website that is underperforming, slow, unreliable or hard to use is a website that customers and prospects will avoid!\n\nLet's make an 𝒂𝒎𝒂𝒛𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝒘𝒆𝒃𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒆 𝒕𝒉𝒂𝒕 𝒘𝒊𝒍𝒍 𝒉𝒆𝒍𝒑 𝒚𝒐𝒖𝒓 𝒃𝒖𝒔𝒊𝒏𝒆𝒔𝒔 𝒇𝒍𝒐𝒖𝒓𝒊𝒔𝒉, one that keeps your customers attention, one that will look great on all devices. One that is running at optimum speed, secure and shows up in keyword searches, \n\n𝐓𝐡𝐢𝐬 𝐢𝐬 𝐡𝐨𝐰 𝐈 𝐜𝐚𝐧 𝐭𝐨 𝐡𝐞𝐥𝐩 𝐲𝐨𝐮:\n\n🔹Brand and Web Design\n🔹Custom WordPress website \n🔹Child Theme Creation/Customization\n🔹Update your current website so it runs more effectively\n🔹Transform your ideas into reality\n🔹Proper SSL certificates\n🔹Responsive designs\n🔹SEO optimized website\n🔹Tech support and maintenance after your website is live\n\nMy 20 year background in customer service has taught me to appreciate the value of how you work with others. It has instilled in me strengths such as:\n~Creativity\n~Attention to details\n~Customer service\n~Always learning\n~Problem solving\n~Communication \n\nPlease reach out to me so we can schedule a call so we can see how we fit together!\n\n𝐢𝐚𝐧𝐝𝐫𝐚@𝐝𝐚𝐫𝐤𝐩𝐚𝐥𝐦𝐝𝐢𝐠𝐢𝐭𝐚𝐥.𝐜𝐨𝐦\n\n𝐝𝐚𝐫𝐤𝐩𝐚𝐥𝐦𝐝𝐢𝐠𝐢𝐭𝐚𝐥.𝐜𝐨𝐦\n",
